    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bidirectional iterator over values.</para><para>Dereferencing this iterator will return a reference to the user-defined value of the node. Values may be altered in-place while they are members of a container. </para>    </detaileddescription>
